                        ],
                        "form": "hôte"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "df25732f-80dc-3785-9a27-926af197e814",
                        "entry_id": "bd349223-e722-3720-ac21-2c1851a29bd6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Femme qui reçoit dans sa demeure ou un lieu dont elle est responsable."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ef8a7a4-a465-4776-9c0e-9169bee090d1",
                                "sense_id": "df25732f-80dc-3785-9a27-926af197e814",
                                "text": "Nous dormîmes honteusement jusqu'à huit heures, et je ne sais combien de temps nous aurions prolongé cette grasse matinée, si l’hôtesse n'était venue nous apporter le café, […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "29a0eb96-8361-412c-825a-6a9b70ff9c43",
                                "sense_id": "df25732f-80dc-3785-9a27-926af197e814",
                                "text": "Le Régiment des Gardes de retour à Paris, je ne pus loger chez mon hôtesse, parce que son mari s’était bien gardé de me réserver une chambre."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7104cf66-1e39-310c-ac69-6863f69aac1b",
                        "entry_id": "bd349223-e722-3720-ac21-2c1851a29bd6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Femme qui accueille et prend en charge des visiteurs, des clients. → voir hôtesse d’accueil, bar à hôtesses, hôtesse de caisse et hôtesse de l’air"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bd558055-6d43-4075-8fa0-63eba1195041",
                                "sense_id": "7104cf66-1e39-310c-ac69-6863f69aac1b",
                                "text": "La voix languide d’une hôtesse qui avait l’air de sortir à l’instant d’un orgasme dévastateur annonça l’embarquement immédiat dans l’avion de Malone"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "206a88c9-661b-41df-8609-de3a63ff4ddd",
                        "source_entry_id": "bd349223-e722-3720-ac21-2c1851a29bd6",
                        "source_sense_id": "df25732f-80dc-3785-9a27-926af197e814",
                        "source_sense_description": "Pendant féminin de l’hôte.",
                        "target_lang_word": "Gastgeberin",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Gastgeberin",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6cd0e681-5868-3e8a-8bd3-b85c54a72558",
                                        "entry_id": "e81c4f14-d657-390f-af8a-eda775c45ed0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "eine weibliche Person, die jemanden bei sich zu Gast hat"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d022ac5f-cb92-44c6-9f36-7fc1d52c7722",
                                                "sense_id": "6cd0e681-5868-3e8a-8bd3-b85c54a72558",
                                                "text": "Die Gastgeberinnen gewannen das Eröffnungsspiel der Fußball-WM mit 4:0."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "545cbd88-64d9-4697-a58d-0e9d089fc4c1",
                                                "sense_id": "6cd0e681-5868-3e8a-8bd3-b85c54a72558",
                                                "text": "Frau Börner war bekannt dafür, eine gute Gastgeberin zu sein."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c3d2fc2-0e02-4857-b56a-340e879713a8",
                                                "sense_id": "6cd0e681-5868-3e8a-8bd3-b85c54a72558",
                                                "text": "Und da 50 Gäste nicht in die Kachelstube passen, ließ die Gastgeberin ein weißes Zelt aufbauen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1914996a-c6a2-4894-aae1-e343ace1b91a",
                                                "sense_id": "6cd0e681-5868-3e8a-8bd3-b85c54a72558",
                                                "text": "„Gaby stellte mich der Gastgebrin vor, einer Frau mit dunklen Haaren, in die sich schon graue Strähnen mischten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "69f42066-f6c3-4ec7-ab45-8796d41f965f",
                                                "sense_id": "6cd0e681-5868-3e8a-8bd3-b85c54a72558",
                                                "text": "„In diese Kategorie fällt auch die folgende Geschichte einer junonischen Gastgeberin, die eine Soiree gibt und ihre Gäste in großer Abendrobe mit einem prächtigen Papagei auf der linken Schulter empfängt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4cbe37b-094b-4718-a5e3-a49ca6bf9f6e",
                                                "sense_id": "6cd0e681-5868-3e8a-8bd3-b85c54a72558",
                                                "text": "„Ich bin eine lausige Gastgeberin und ich bin es gern.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "37170cb4-ba13-46f6-9026-3c5401262407",
                        "source_entry_id": "bd349223-e722-3720-ac21-2c1851a29bd6",
                        "source_sense_id": "df25732f-80dc-3785-9a27-926af197e814",
                        "source_sense_description": "Pendant féminin de l’hôte.",
                        "target_lang_word": "hostess",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hostess",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e06374c-b3b2-3659-aae7-c280c8ae848c",
                                        "entry_id": "eb7f1b3f-d0a9-39e2-b2f6-1132c7906f43",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A female host."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5e5102f-755b-49ab-bfe8-b6b9d2d3361a",
                                                "sense_id": "6e06374c-b3b2-3659-aae7-c280c8ae848c",
                                                "text": "The host and hostess greeted their guests at the door."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fef5e017-910a-47b4-b083-8ca1359bb0d8",
                                                "sense_id": "6e06374c-b3b2-3659-aae7-c280c8ae848c",
                                                "text": "The [Washington] Post's proprietor through those turbulent [Watergate] days, Katharine Graham, held a double place in Washington’s hierarchy: at once regal Georgetown hostess and scrappy newshound, ready to hold the establishment to account."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6587cd55-8b72-34be-b78c-96ef7cd35586",
                                        "entry_id": "eb7f1b3f-d0a9-39e2-b2f6-1132c7906f43",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A female innkeeper."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "58e6db8c-1daa-34f4-bc7d-3c70efa1445b",
                                        "entry_id": "eb7f1b3f-d0a9-39e2-b2f6-1132c7906f43",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Stewardess: a woman steward on an airplane."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6c4abd70-1fe6-302f-bdd7-c0283a5c2ff7",
                                        "entry_id": "eb7f1b3f-d0a9-39e2-b2f6-1132c7906f43",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bar hostess or bargirl; a paid female companion offering conversation and in some cases sex."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "83348956-3ea3-379d-a50f-c887bcc86cca",
                                        "entry_id": "eb7f1b3f-d0a9-39e2-b2f6-1132c7906f43",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A female prostitute."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Philippines"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "hostess",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8803db3f-2e46-3122-b18b-6ab76372cac0",
                                        "entry_id": "afa93739-fb09-3a25-9707-b1d30a3f40e2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To host, as a woman."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "037bfe1c-738e-49f3-92b2-dec5ca76f84b",
                                                "sense_id": "8803db3f-2e46-3122-b18b-6ab76372cac0",
                                                "text": "Later in January, the alum club hostessed the initiation brunch at the Pi Beta Phi chapter house. It was thrilling to see so many girls with such enthusiasm!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b66db123-b373-4a77-8fb5-3a3a4a0914b7",
                                                "sense_id": "8803db3f-2e46-3122-b18b-6ab76372cac0",
                                                "text": "Over the years she has maintained a close relationship with several former students. Currently, she alternates between visiting and hostessing two in Roanoke and Greenville, N.C., respectively, and is a proud godgrandmother to one’s new baby."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89aeec64-884e-42c9-8eb1-da5141c9d2fd",
                                                "sense_id": "8803db3f-2e46-3122-b18b-6ab76372cac0",
                                                "text": "Dad and I had left early to make sure to get a booth in the back. But when I got there, Teddy Selander’s older sister was hostessing and she said, ‘You’re meeting Dean West? He’s sitting right over here,’ loud enough for everyone to hear."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
